   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "At write time the registry has one main job: SAY NO to a bad change (HTTP 409), so the producer never gets an id for it.\nPersistence: a single-partition, compacted Kafka topic (_schemas). Production rule: producers do NOT register schemas; CI/CD does.",
   "originalText": "At write time the registry has one main job: SAY NO to a bad change (HTTP 409), so the producer never gets an id for it.\nPersistence: a single-partition, compacted Kafka topic (_schemas). Production rule: producers do NOT register schemas; CI/CD does.",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "sr2-00051",
   "autoResize": true,
