   "text": "Same schema again to the same\nsubject returns the same id, no new\nversion. So CI \"register on deploy\" is\nsafe to retry.",
   "originalText": "Same schema again to the same\nsubject returns the same id, no new\nversion. So CI \"register on deploy\" is\nsafe to retry.",
