   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Never hard-delete a schema whose id might still be inside retained data, even if no subject \"uses\" it any more. With indefinite retention or archives\nthat means NEVER.",
   "originalText": "Never hard-delete a schema whose id might still be inside retained data, even if no subject \"uses\" it any more. With indefinite retention or archives\nthat means NEVER.",
