   "text": "CI registers on merge; producers only\nconsume what exists. The audit trail\nis the pipeline, not \"whichever pod\nstarted first\".",
   "originalText": "CI registers on merge; producers only\nconsume what exists. The audit trail\nis the pipeline, not \"whichever pod\nstarted first\".",
