   "text": "Ten replicas starting at once, all\nauto-registering, can interleave\nunpredictably. With explicit\nregistration, order is a pipeline step.",
   "originalText": "Ten replicas starting at once, all\nauto-registering, can interleave\nunpredictably. With explicit\nregistration, order is a pipeline step.",
