   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The registry client is INDEPENDENT of\nthe Kafka client: it only does HTTP and\nbyte framing. So it works with any Kafka\nclient, even if yours differs from kafkajs.\nConfirm that, and use encode / decode on\nthe value Buffer.",
